{
  "$comment": "The driver lanes: what each one builds and owns (docs/drivers/README.md). Globs end in /** (a directory) or name a file; a * inside a bindings name stands for any rest. src-tauri/tests/driver_guard.rs reads the rust globs, src-tauri/tests/manifest_features.rs the test files, and dev/scripts/lane*.mjs everything. tests are the lib test filters of `lane.mjs <lane> test`; env the variables of the lane real-server suites; smoke the shared vitest files every `lane.mjs <lane> ts` runs too.",
